{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000001", "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "1% - That was the conversion rate from social media leads to a qualified meeting.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000001"}, {"quote": "Call the client. Find out what they want. Send the brochures. Follow up. Follow up again. Pray.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000001"}], "text": "A traditional sales process involves calling the client, identifying their needs, sending brochures, and following up, but may only achieve a 1% conversion rate from social media leads to a qualified meeting."}, "title": "Traditional Sales Process", "topic": "Conversion rates"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:knowledge:31ac273cff493e24", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Traditional Sales Process", "topic": "Conversion rates", "topic_slug": "conversion-rates"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Multiple touchpoints. Video calls. Materials that help the client understand why Dubai, why now, why with you. You are not selling a unit. You are building enough trust for someone to wire a significant amount of money across a border.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000003"}], "text": "An effective sales process looks nothing like the traditional method and involves multiple touchpoints, video calls, and materials that help the client understand the value of the offer, aiming to build enough trust for financial commitment."}, "title": "Effective Sales Process", "topic": "Conversion rates"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:knowledge:0c29815b71e7311d", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Effective Sales Process", "topic": "Conversion rates", "topic_slug": "conversion-rates"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000003", "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If your conversion from lead to meeting is under five percent, look at the process before you blame the leads.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000004"}], "text": "If your conversion rate from lead to meeting is under five percent, examine the sales process before blaming the leads."}, "title": "Improved Conversion Strategy", "topic": "Conversion rates"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:knowledge:bf22259a745ab2b1", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Improved Conversion Strategy", "topic": "Conversion rates", "topic_slug": "conversion-rates"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Full break down of the pricess in the Off-plan course inside my academy.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000004"}], "text": "A full breakdown of the sales process is available in the Off-plan course inside the author's academy."}, "title": "Sales Process Course Offering", "topic": "Training"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:knowledge:49b458290e93cc9b", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Sales Process Course Offering", "topic": "Training", "topic_slug": "training"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Last was a Joke of course... Or the premium version: call the client, pitch the newest launch, invite them to the sales centre, push the expression of interest form.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000002"}], "text": "Contrast between the traditional sales process and the premium version is presented, highlighting a shared method of direct client calls and document exchanges with slight variations in pitching tactics."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Sales Process Comparison", "topic": "Conversion rates"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:expression:2dd4796c3becec24", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Sales Process Comparison", "topic": "Conversion rates", "topic_slug": "conversion-rates"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000001", "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000002", "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "conversion rate from social media leads to a qualified meeting.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000001"}, {"quote": "conversion from social media lead to qualified prospect reaches thirty-five percent or more.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:u000003"}], "text": "The text highlights a significant difference in conversion rates by comparing the traditional 1% rate to the improved 35% or more rate when using a different sales approach."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Diverse Conversion Range", "topic": "Conversion rates"}, "content_hash": "05e796f548eb43520a1acbcf42915fbde722f8cdb2fa89914768674fc02f1082", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b:expression:886a2b5941b423a9", "metadata_hash": "d778f24fbfb09ca65b75a99a9395de50cc5ebdf33601b7d781d337a75f250c6f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-15T03:51:15.321000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "dc03e9870a439061747a80262a680487d3ee339da17293c28364f0720083af40", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-15-1-that-was-the-md-88aee1b67b", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_realestateagenttips-realestateagenttraining-activity-7472133598121455618-kqDW", "title": "Diverse Conversion Range", "topic": "Conversion rates", "topic_slug": "conversion-rates"}
